              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { `JvmCancellation` } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " `JvmCancellation` "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>返回只读的取消状态视图, 只能观察, 不能发起取消.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-kotlin\">val cancellation = context.cancellation()\nwhile (!cancellation.isCancellationRequested()) {\n    context.sleep(100L)\n}\n</code></pre>\n"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "JvmScriptContext.sleep(millis)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "sleep",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**millis** { `Long` } - 毫秒数, 不能为负 ",
                      "name": "**millis**",
                      "type": " `Long` ",
                      "desc": "毫秒数, 不能为负"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { `Unit` } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " `Unit` "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "millis"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>可被取消的休眠. 需要休眠能力; 在 AutoJs6 中停止脚本时中断休眠并抛出 JvmCancellationException.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-kotlin\">context.sleep(500L)\n</code></pre>\n"
            },
            {
