              "desc": "<p>便利方法, 等价于 <code>cancellation().isCancellationRequested()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-kotlin\">if (context.isCancellationRequested()) return &quot;cancelled&quot;\n</code></pre>\n"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "JvmScriptContext.throwIfCancellationRequested()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "throwIfCancellationRequested",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { `Unit` } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " `Unit` "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>便利方法, 等价于 <code>cancellation().throwIfCancellationRequested()</code>. 建议在长循环的每个工作单元之间调用.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-kotlin\">repeat(1000) { index -&gt;\n    context.throwIfCancellationRequested()\n    work(index)\n}\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n"
            }
          ],
